            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.97

- Lyrics now track the music exactly on Amazon Music. The playback position is read from the player itself rather than from the progress bar, which only reports whole seconds and left the timing up to half a second out either way.
]]></description>
